#title: BT-195(BT-88)-Procedure
#description: The corresponding XML element is /*/cac:TenderingProcess/ext:UBLExtensions/ext:UBLExtension/ext:ExtensionContent/efext:EformsExtension/efac:FieldsPrivacy[efbc:FieldIdentifierCode/text()='pro-fea']/efbc:FieldIdentifierCode. 
#xpath: /*/cac:TenderingProcess/ext:UBLExtensions/ext:UBLExtension/ext:ExtensionContent/efext:EformsExtension/efac:FieldsPrivacy[efbc:FieldIdentifierCode/text()='pro-fea']/efbc:FieldIdentifierCode

